test/fixtures/wafer_corpus.json holds the expected values of every check_*
call site in those files, extracted mechanically by
script/extract_wafer_corpus.rb. The upstream corpora are themselves ports of
facebook/duckling's Haskell corpora, under the same license. The fixture
records the upstream commit it was extracted from.

